  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Intersections of Archives and Cultural Funds</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This one-year grant of &#x20ac;17,900 will provide funding toKhazaaen to preserve and promote Palestinian cultureand identity. This project will benefit Palestinians in East Jerusalemand marginalised communities, particularly youth. Theproject creates a space for young Palestinians toconnect with one another and with a distinguishedgroup of Palestinian figures who have effectivelyintegrated archives into their creative and culturalprojects, including art, theatre, music, cinema,research, and folklore. It will allow young people tomeet researchers, artists, and leading specialists torenew their understanding of archives and theirintersection with culture, identity, and social history.</narrative>
  </description>
